{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat WORKSPACE.json; cat packages/contracts/package.json; cat packages/contracts/foundry.toml; cat packages/contracts/remappings.txt; sed -n '1,250p' packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol; rg -n \\\"vrfWrapper|wrapper\\\" -g '\"'!**/node_modules/**'\"' /workspace\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"dependencies\": [],\n  \"primary\": {\n    \"commit\": \"LOCAL_SNAPSHOT\",\n    \"kind\": \"local\",\n    \"path\": \"/workspace\",\n    \"repo\": \"clean-context\",\n    \"requested_commit\": \"LOCAL_SNAPSHOT\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"name\": \"@raffle-fun/contracts\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=22.13 <23\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"hardhat compile && forge build\",\n    \"compile\": \"hardhat compile\",\n    \"test\": \"pnpm test:foundry && pnpm test:hardhat\",\n    \"test:foundry\": \"forge test\",\n    \"test:hardhat\": \"hardhat test nodejs\",\n    \"coverage\": \"forge coverage --report lcov --no-match-coverage '^(script/|src/mocks/|test/)' && node scripts/check-coverage.mjs\",\n    \"gas\": \"forge snapshot --check -j 1 --no-match-test '^(testFuzz|invariant)'\",\n    \"gas:update\": \"forge snapshot -j 1 --no-match-test '^(testFuzz|invariant)'\",\n    \"fmt\": \"forge fmt\",\n    \"fmt:check\": \"forge fmt --check\",\n    \"lint\": \"solhint 'src/**/*.sol' 'test/**/*.sol'\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"slither\": \"slither . --config-file slither.config.json\",\n    \"deploy:sepolia\": \"hardhat ignition deploy ignition/modules/RaffleFun.ts --network sepolia\",\n    \"verify:sepolia\": \"hardhat ignition verify chain-11155111\",\n    \"deployment:write\": \"tsx scripts/write-deployment.ts\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@chainlink/contracts\": \"1.5.0\",\n    \"@openzeppelin/contracts\": \"5.6.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-ignition\": \"3.1.8\",\n    \"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-ignition-viem\": \"3.1.6\",\n    \"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-toolbox-viem\": \"5.0.7\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"26.1.2\",\n    \"dotenv\": \"17.4.2\",\n    \"hardhat\": \"3.11.1\",\n    \"solhint\": \"6.2.3\",\n    \"tsx\": \"4.23.1\",\n    \"typescript\": \"6.0.3\",\n    \"viem\": \"2.55.10\",\n    \"zod\": \"4.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n[profile.default]\nsrc = \"src\"\ntest = \"test/foundry\"\nscript = \"script\"\nout = \"out\"\nlibs = [\"lib\", \"node_modules\"]\nsolc_version = \"0.8.36\"\nevm_version = \"cancun\"\noptimizer = true\noptimizer_runs = 200\nvia_ir = false\nfuzz = { runs = 1_000, seed = \"0x524146464c45\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 256, depth = 64, fail_on_revert = false }\ngas_reports = [\"Raffle\", \"RaffleFactory\"]\n\n[profile.ci]\nfuzz = { runs = 10_000 }\ninvariant = { runs = 1_000, depth = 256, fail_on_revert = false }\n\n[profile.audit]\nfuzz = { runs = 100_000, seed = \"0x41554449545f46555a5a\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 1_000, depth = 256, fail_on_revert = false }\n\n[profile.audit_strict]\nfuzz = { runs = 10_000, seed = \"0x41554449545f535452494354\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 1_000, depth = 256, fail_on_revert = true }\n\n[profile.audit_release]\nfuzz = { runs = 100_000, seed = \"0x52454c454153455f43414d504149474e\" }\ninvariant = { runs = 5_000, depth = 512, fail_on_revert = true, timeout = 3_600 }\n\n[profile.coverage]\nvia_ir = false\noptimizer = false\n\n[profile.comparison]\nvia_ir = true\noptimizer = true\noptimizer_runs = 1_000\n\n[fmt]\nline_length = 120\ntab_width = 4\nbracket_spacing = true\nint_types = \"long\"\nquote_style = \"double\"\nnumber_underscore = \"thousands\"\nsort_imports = true\n@openzeppelin/contracts/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/\nforge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity 0.8.36;\n\nimport { Clones } from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/Clones.sol\";\nimport { IERC20Metadata } from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC20/extensions/IERC20Metadata.sol\";\nimport { IERC721 } from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/IERC721.sol\";\nimport { ReentrancyGuard } from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol\";\nimport { IERC165 } from \"@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/introspection/IERC165.sol\";\n\nimport { Raffle } from \"./Raffle.sol\";\nimport { IRaffle } from \"./interfaces/IRaffle.sol\";\nimport { IRaffleFactory } from \"./interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol\";\nimport { RaffleConstants } from \"./libraries/RaffleConstants.sol\";\n\n/// @title raffle.fun Canonical USDC Raffle Factory\n/// @author heesho\n/// @notice Atomically creates, funds, and registers autonomous fixed-implementation raffle clones.\n/// @dev The implementation, canonical six-decimal USDC, treasury, fee, and Chainlink configuration are immutable. The\n///      factory has no owner, pause, upgrade, rescue, or mutable protocol configuration.\n/// @custom:version 1.0.0\ncontract RaffleFactory is IRaffleFactory, ReentrancyGuard {\n    // Constants\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    uint32 public constant override callbackGasLimit = RaffleConstants.VRF_CALLBACK_GAS_LIMIT;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    uint16 public constant override requestConfirmations = RaffleConstants.VRF_REQUEST_CONFIRMATIONS;\n\n    // Immutables and state\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    address public immutable override quoteToken;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    address public immutable override vrfWrapper;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    address public immutable override protocolTreasury;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    address public immutable override raffleImplementation;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    uint256 public override raffleCount;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    mapping(uint256 raffleId => address raffle) public override raffleById;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    mapping(address raffle => uint256 raffleId) public override idByRaffle;\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    mapping(address raffle => bool registered) public override isRaffle;\n\n    // Constructor\n\n    /// @notice Deploys the ownerless factory and its locked raffle implementation with one immutable configuration.\n    /// @dev The quote token must report exactly six decimals; the wrapper and quote token must contain deployed code.\n    ///      Deployment tooling must supply and verify the target chain's official USDC address because the constructor\n    ///      cannot prove token identity from metadata.\n    /// @param quoteToken_ Target chain's official six-decimal USDC contract trusted by every raffle.\n    /// @param vrfWrapper_ Official Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper for the target chain.\n    /// @param protocolTreasury_ Immutable protocol-fee recipient used by every raffle.\n    constructor(address quoteToken_, address vrfWrapper_, address protocolTreasury_) {\n        _requireContract(quoteToken_);\n        _requireContract(vrfWrapper_);\n        if (protocolTreasury_ == address(0)) revert ZeroAddress();\n\n        uint8 quoteDecimals = 0;\n        try IERC20Metadata(quoteToken_).decimals() returns (uint8 decimals_) {\n            quoteDecimals = decimals_;\n        } catch {\n            revert UnsupportedQuoteToken(quoteToken_);\n        }\n        if (quoteDecimals != RaffleConstants.QUOTE_TOKEN_DECIMALS) {\n            revert InvalidQuoteTokenDecimals(quoteDecimals, RaffleConstants.QUOTE_TOKEN_DECIMALS);\n        }\n\n        if (protocolTreasury_ == address(this) || protocolTreasury_ == quoteToken_ || protocolTreasury_ == vrfWrapper_)\n        {\n            revert UnsafeProtocolDestination(protocolTreasury_);\n        }\n\n        quoteToken = quoteToken_;\n        vrfWrapper = vrfWrapper_;\n        protocolTreasury = protocolTreasury_;\n\n        address implementation = address(new Raffle(quoteToken_, vrfWrapper_));\n        if (protocolTreasury_ == implementation) revert UnsafeProtocolDestination(protocolTreasury_);\n        raffleImplementation = implementation;\n    }\n\n    // External state-changing functions\n\n    /// @inheritdoc IRaffleFactory\n    function createRaffle(CreateRaffleParams calldata params) external override nonReentrant returns (address raffle) {\n        _validateCreateParams(params);\n        uint256 currentTime = block.timestamp;\n        if (params.endTime <= currentTime) revert InvalidEndTime(currentTime, params.endTime);\n        uint256 saleDuration = uint256(params.endTime) - currentTime;\n        if (saleDuration > RaffleConstants.MAX_SALE_DURATION) {\n            revert SaleDurationTooLong(saleDuration, RaffleConstants.MAX_SALE_DURATION);\n        }\n        uint256 raffleId = ++raffleCount;\n        raffle = Clones.clone(raffleImplementation);\n        // The fresh fixed-target clone can initialize only once; this function is nonReentrant and atomic.\n        // slither-disable-next-line reentrancy-no-eth\n        IRaffle(raffle)\n            .initialize(\n                IRaffle.RaffleInitParams({\n                sponsor: msg.sender,\n                sponsorRecipient: params.sponsorRecipient,\n                protocolTreasury: protocolTreasury,\n                prizeToken: params.prizeToken,\n                prizeTokenId: params.prizeTokenId,\n                raffleId: raffleId,\n                reserveEntries: params.reserveEntries,\n                endTime: params.endTime\n            })\n            );\n\n        raffleById[raffleId] = raffle;\n        idByRaffle[raffle] = raffleId;\n        isRaffle[raffle] = true;\n\n        IERC721 prize = IERC721(params.prizeToken);\n        prize.safeTransferFrom(msg.sender, raffle, params.prizeTokenId);\n        if (prize.ownerOf(params.prizeTokenId) != raffle) {\n            revert PrizeEscrowVerificationFailed(raffle, params.prizeToken, params.prizeTokenId);\n        }\n        if (IRaffle(raffle).status() != IRaffle.Status.Active) {\n            revert PrizeEscrowVerificationFailed(raffle, params.prizeToken, params.prizeTokenId);\n        }\n\n        emit RaffleCreated(\n            raffleId,\n            raffle,\n            msg.sender,\n            params.sponsorRecipient,\n            params.prizeToken,\n            params.prizeTokenId,\n            quoteToken,\n            protocolTreasury,\n            params.reserveEntries,\n            params.endTime\n        );\n    }\n\n    // Private view helpers\n\n    /// @dev Validates the sponsor-selected token, recipient, reserve, and supported ERC-721 interface before cloning.\n    /// @param params Prospective raffle configuration supplied by the sponsor.\n    function _validateCreateParams(CreateRaffleParams calldata params) private view {\n        _requireContract(params.prizeToken);\n        if (params.sponsorRecipient == address(0)) revert ZeroAddress();\n        if (\n            params.prizeToken == address(this) || params.prizeToken == quoteToken || params.prizeToken == vrfWrapper\n                || params.prizeToken == raffleImplementation || isRaffle[params.prizeToken]\n        ) {\n            revert UnsafeProtocolDestination(params.prizeToken);\n        }\n        if (\n            params.sponsorRecipient == address(this) || params.sponsorRecipient == quoteToken\n                || params.sponsorRecipient == vrfWrapper || params.sponsorRecipient == params.prizeToken\n                || params.sponsorRecipient == raffleImplementation || isRaffle[params.sponsorRecipient]\n        ) {\n            revert UnsafeProtocolDestination(params.sponsorRecipient);\n        }\n\n        bool supports721 = false;\n        try IERC165(params.prizeToken).supportsInterface(type(IERC721).interfaceId) returns (bool supported) {\n            supports721 = supported;\n        } catch {\n            revert UnsupportedPrizeToken(params.prizeToken);\n        }\n        if (!supports721) revert UnsupportedPrizeToken(params.prizeToken);\n        if (params.reserveEntries == 0) revert ZeroReserveEntries();\n    }\n\n    /// @dev Reverts unless an address contains deployed code.\n    /// @param account Address required to be a contract.\n    function _requireContract(address account) private view {\n        if (account.code.length == 0) revert NotContract(account);\n    }\n}\n/workspace/pnpm-lock.yaml:5934:  http2-wrapper@2.2.1:\n/workspace/pnpm-lock.yaml:13421:      http2-wrapper: 2.2.1\n/workspace/pnpm-lock.yaml:13525:  http2-wrapper@2.2.1:\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:36:    address public immutable override vrfWrapper;\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:59:    /// @dev The quote token must report exactly six decimals; the wrapper and quote token must contain deployed code.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:63:    /// @param vrfWrapper_ Official Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper for the target chain.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:65:    constructor(address quoteToken_, address vrfWrapper_, address protocolTreasury_) {\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:67:        _requireContract(vrfWrapper_);\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:80:        if (protocolTreasury_ == address(this) || protocolTreasury_ == quoteToken_ || protocolTreasury_ == vrfWrapper_)\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:86:        vrfWrapper = vrfWrapper_;\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:89:        address implementation = address(new Raffle(quoteToken_, vrfWrapper_));\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:158:            params.prizeToken == address(this) || params.prizeToken == quoteToken || params.prizeToken == vrfWrapper\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:165:                || params.sponsorRecipient == vrfWrapper || params.sponsorRecipient == params.prizeToken\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:85:    /// @param fee Native-token wei actually paid to the wrapper for the request.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:99:    /// @param receivedRequestId Request ID supplied by the wrapper callback.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:318:    ///      value above the wrapper's actual fee is returned to the caller atomically.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:359:    /// @notice Returns the wrapper's current native direct-funding price for the configured callback.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:360:    /// @return fee Native-token wei currently quoted by the wrapper; the value may change before request inclusion.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:399:    /// @return gasLimit Callback gas units requested from the wrapper.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:426:    /// @notice Returns the immutable Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:427:    /// @return wrapper Wrapper contract.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:428:    function vrfWrapper() external view returns (IVRFV2PlusWrapper wrapper);\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:112:    /// @notice Returns the immutable Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper used by every raffle.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:113:    /// @return wrapperAddress Wrapper contract address.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:114:    function vrfWrapper() external view returns (address wrapperAddress);\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:121:    /// @return gasLimit Callback gas units requested from the wrapper.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:141:    /// @dev True only while the wrapper request call is executing, so a synchronous callback cannot resolve early.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:154:    /// @param vrfWrapper_ Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper fixed for the implementation and all clones.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:155:    constructor(address quoteToken_, address vrfWrapper_)\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:157:        VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase(_validatedVrfWrapper(vrfWrapper_))\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:446:    function vrfWrapper() public view override returns (IVRFV2PlusWrapper wrapper) {\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:447:        wrapper = i_vrfV2PlusWrapper;\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:607:    /// @dev Validates the wrapper before passing it to the inherited constructor initializer.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:608:    /// @param wrapper Prospective Chainlink wrapper address.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:609:    /// @return validatedWrapper The same nonzero wrapper address.\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:610:    function _validatedVrfWrapper(address wrapper) private pure returns (address validatedWrapper) {\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:611:        if (wrapper == address(0)) revert ZeroAddress();\n/workspace/packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:612:        validatedWrapper = wrapper;\n/workspace/DESIGN.md:2:Ethereum NFT raffle; immutable factory, ERC-1167 clones with immutable implementation. One entry costs 1,000,000 units of canonical six-decimal USDC. One purchase mints a transferable ERC721 ticket representing a contiguous inclusive range. Exactly one ERC721 prize is escrowed atomically at creation. Reserve met awards NFT and 95% sponsor / 5% treasury. Reserve missed awards 80% gross to winner, 15% sponsor, 5% treasury. Refund outcome pays 100% per entry and returns prize. Rounding is floor on aggregate protocol fee; remainder must be allocated without loss. No administrator, mutable configuration or upgrade. Request window [sale end, end+2days); callback accepted strictly before request timestamp+2days. Refunds open at deadline. Callback records result only. Settlement is permissionless, storage-only; redemption requires current ticket owner, burns claim atomically, and must revert all effects on delivery failure. Sponsor and treasury can claim independently after settlement. Never move assets between raffle clones. Quote token and Chainlink wrapper are trusted canonical dependencies; arbitrary prize contracts and ticket recipients are untrusted. Frontend discovery is advisory; transaction decisions must reread current chain state.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
