{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"_kritt_extractor_helper\":true,\"stub\":false,\"stub_explanation\":\"\",\"results\":[{\"flow_summary\":\"A request outside the Active lifecycle state—including before prize escrow, after another draw request, after resolution, or during refunds—is rejected before any fee processing.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:69 ReentrancyGuard.nonReentrant - enters the shared reentrancy guard before dispatching the function body.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:240 Raffle.requestDraw - accepts the payable, no-argument external call.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:241 Raffle.requestDraw - requires lifecycle status Active.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:574 Raffle._requireStatus - reverts with InvalidStatus when the current status is not Active.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with InvalidStatus; no state change or native payment persists.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":241,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The actor chooses the raffle and submission moment; attached msg.value is returned by transaction rollback. A repeat call after a successful request encounters Drawing here.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This is the one-request lifecycle boundary that prevents duplicate VRF spending and draw replay.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"An otherwise active raffle rejects draw initiation before the exclusive sale end.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:240 Raffle.requestDraw - enters under nonReentrant with caller-controlled value and transaction timing.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:241 Raffle.requestDraw - passes the Active-status gate.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:242 Raffle.requestDraw - compares block.timestamp with endTime and rejects an early request.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with RaffleNotEnded(endTime, block.timestamp).\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":242,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-controlled submission timing reaches the sale-end comparison; attached msg.value rolls back.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The check prevents randomness from being requested while entry sales can still alter the draw population.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"An active raffle called at or after sale end is rejected if no entries were sold.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:240 Raffle.requestDraw - enters the payable external handler.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:241 Raffle.requestDraw - passes Active status.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:242 Raffle.requestDraw - passes the sale-end gate.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:243 Raffle.requestDraw - reads totalEntries and rejects the zero-entry state.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with NoEntriesSold.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":243,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The actor selects an empty raffle and a post-end submission time; attached native value is returned by rollback.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This avoids paying for an unusable draw and ensures the later modulo operation cannot have a zero denominator.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A nonempty active raffle rejects requests at or after the exclusive two-day draw-request deadline.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:241 Raffle.requestDraw - passes Active status.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:242 Raffle.requestDraw - passes the sale-end check.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:243 Raffle.requestDraw - passes the nonempty-entry check.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:458 Raffle.drawRequestDeadline - derives endTime plus DRAW_REQUEST_TIMEOUT.\",\"packages/contracts/src/libraries/RaffleConstants.sol:33 RaffleConstants.DRAW_REQUEST_TIMEOUT - fixes the request window at two days.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:245 Raffle.requestDraw - rejects a timestamp at or after the computed deadline.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with DrawRequestWindowExpired(requestDeadline, block.timestamp).\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":245,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-controlled submission timing reaches the exclusive deadline comparison; msg.value is returned by rollback.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This cutoff separates draw initiation from the full-refund liveness path.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"Failure of the immutable wrapper's initial native-price lookup bubbles up before the raffle changes lifecycle state.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:241 Raffle.requestDraw - passes lifecycle, sale-end, entry-count, and deadline validation through line 247.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:249 Raffle.requestDraw - dispatches to getVrfRequestPrice before mutating draw state.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:436 Raffle.getVrfRequestPrice - enters the wrapper-pricing helper.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:437 Raffle.getVrfRequestPrice - externally calls calculateRequestPriceNative for a 300,000-gas, one-word request; a dependency revert bubbles.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"The wrapper pricing failure reverts the transaction; the raffle remains Active and no native payment persists.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":437,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The actor's submission timing reaches the wrapper's current pricing state. The lookup uses fixed request parameters, and attached msg.value is not forwarded before the failure.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This read-only external dependency is an availability boundary that must succeed before caller funding can be validated.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"After obtaining the wrapper's current native price, the handler rejects caller value below that quote before changing raffle state.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:249 Raffle.requestDraw - obtains the current wrapper quote.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:436 Raffle.getVrfRequestPrice - requests the fixed callback configuration's native price.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:250 Raffle.requestDraw - compares caller-supplied msg.value against quotedFee and rejects underfunding.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with InsufficientVrfFee(quotedFee, msg.value).\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":250,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-controlled msg.value directly reaches the fee-coverage comparison.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The validation prevents an underfunded oracle request and ensures draw costs are supplied by the permissionless requester.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"If the value-bearing wrapper request fails after validation, its revert atomically cancels the provisional Drawing transition and fee transfer.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:252 Raffle.requestDraw - provisionally sets status to Drawing.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:253 Raffle.requestDraw - records drawRequestedAt and marks the request in flight through line 254.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:255 Raffle.requestDraw - encodes native-payment extra arguments.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:257 Raffle.requestDraw - dispatches the funded request through the Chainlink consumer base.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:82 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.requestRandomnessPayInNative - obtains the actual native request price.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:84 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.requestRandomnessPayInNative - calls requestRandomWordsInNative with the computed native value; a wrapper revert bubbles.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"The wrapper request revert rolls back all provisional raffle writes, wrapper-side changes, and native transfers.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol\",\"flow_line\":84,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-supplied msg.value funds the computed requestPrice sent to the immutable wrapper; no payment or request persists if that call reverts.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This is the principal external availability and native-value boundary for draw creation, with correctness depending on cross-contract atomic rollback.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A valid caller supplying exactly the actual wrapper price pays for one random word, records the request, and leaves the raffle in Drawing without invoking caller code.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:240 Raffle.requestDraw - enters under nonReentrant and passes validation through line 250.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:252 Raffle.requestDraw - sets Drawing, records drawRequestedAt, and marks the request in flight through line 254.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:255 Raffle.requestDraw - creates ExtraArgsV1 with nativePayment set to true.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/libraries/VRFV2PlusClient.sol:22 VRFV2PlusClient._argsToBytes - ABI-encodes the tagged native-payment arguments.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:257 Raffle.requestDraw - requests one word with a 300,000 gas callback limit and 30 confirmations.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:84 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.requestRandomnessPayInNative - forwards the actual native price to requestRandomWordsInNative and returns its request ID.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:258 Raffle.requestDraw - verifies that msg.value covers the returned paidPrice.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:259 Raffle.requestDraw - stores vrfRequestId and clears the in-flight marker through line 260.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:262 Raffle.requestDraw - computes zero excess and skips the caller-refund branch.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:272 Raffle.requestDraw - emits DrawRequested and returns requestId.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Persists Drawing, drawRequestedAt, and vrfRequestId; transfers paidPrice wei to the wrapper; emits DrawRequested; returns requestId.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":257,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-controlled msg.value equal to paidPrice funds the immutable VRF wrapper; caller identity is recorded as requester, and submission time becomes drawRequestedAt.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This is the native-value sink and asynchronous-randomness dispatch that closes entry sales and starts the callback deadline.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A valid overfunded request pays only the actual wrapper price, records the request, and returns the exact excess to msg.sender through a raw native call.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:240 Raffle.requestDraw - enters under nonReentrant, whose guard remains active across external calls.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:252 Raffle.requestDraw - precommits Drawing and request-in-flight state.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:257 Raffle.requestDraw - pays the wrapper and receives the request ID and actual price.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:259 Raffle.requestDraw - stores vrfRequestId and clears the in-flight marker.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:262 Raffle.requestDraw - derives excess as msg.value minus paidPrice.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:265 Raffle.requestDraw - selects msg.sender as the refund recipient.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:267 Raffle.requestDraw - forwards the excess and available call gas to caller-controlled code with empty calldata.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:269 Raffle.requestDraw - accepts a successful refund call.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:272 Raffle.requestDraw - emits DrawRequested with the returned excess.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"The wrapper payment and Drawing state persist; excess wei is transferred to msg.sender; DrawRequested is emitted.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":267,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-controlled msg.value minus paidPrice becomes the raw-call value, and caller-controlled msg.sender becomes its target.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This executes arbitrary requester contract code after sensitive draw state has been written; the active shared reentrancy guard is the primary boundary protecting guarded raffle operations.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"If an overpaying contract caller rejects or otherwise fails the excess-native transfer, the entire draw request is reverted.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:252 Raffle.requestDraw - provisionally changes lifecycle and request timing state.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:257 Raffle.requestDraw - provisionally pays for and creates the wrapper request.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:259 Raffle.requestDraw - provisionally records the returned request ID.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:262 Raffle.requestDraw - computes a nonzero excess.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:267 Raffle.requestDraw - calls msg.sender with the excess.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:269 Raffle.requestDraw - detects a false call result and reverts with NativeRefundFailed.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with NativeRefundFailed(msg.sender, excess); EVM atomicity removes the wrapper request and payment and restores all raffle state.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":269,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Caller-controlled identity selects the refund code, and caller-controlled overpayment determines the native value that code must accept.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"Requester-controlled callback behavior determines whether an otherwise valid oracle request commits, so rollback must cover both contracts and all preceding writes.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"After a request exists, any non-wrapper account attempting to inject a request ID or random words through rawFulfillRandomWords is rejected at the inherited callback authorization boundary.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:259 Raffle.requestDraw - a successful request stores the authoritative vrfRequestId.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - exposes the asynchronous callback entrypoint.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:102 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - loads the immutable wrapper address.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - compares msg.sender with the wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:104 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - reverts for every non-wrapper sender before dispatching to the raffle handler.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reverts with OnlyVRFWrapperCanFulfill; supplied request ID and random words do not reach Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol\",\"flow_line\":103,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The actor controls msg.sender, the proposed request ID, and proposed random words, but cannot satisfy the immutable wrapper-identity check.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This authorization boundary prevents the permissionless draw requester or another account from forging the randomness that selects the winning ticket.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A timely one-word callback from the immutable wrapper selects an entry and records NftWon when sold entries meet the reserve.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:272 Raffle.requestDraw - completes initiation with status Drawing and a persisted request ID.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - receives the asynchronous callback.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - requires msg.sender to be the immutable wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - dispatches to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:510 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - accepts only a non-in-flight Drawing callback with the matching request ID, one word, and a timestamp strictly before callbackDeadline through line 516.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:518 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - maps randomWords[0] into the one-based range from 1 through totalEntries.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:519 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - stores winningEntry and resolvedAt through line 520.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:521 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - sets NftWon because totalEntries is at least reserveEntries.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:523 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - emits RaffleResolved.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Persists winningEntry, resolvedAt, and status NftWon; emits RaffleResolved.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":518,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The original requester controls funding and request timing, but not the winner input. Wrapper-authenticated randomWords[0] reaches the modulo selection, while preexisting totalEntries and reserveEntries select the NFT-result branch.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"Authenticated randomness directly determines the bearer ticket entitled to the escrowed NFT.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A timely one-word callback from the immutable wrapper selects an entry and records CashWon when sales miss the reserve.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:272 Raffle.requestDraw - completes initiation with status Drawing and a persisted request ID.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - receives the asynchronous response.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - enforces the immutable wrapper-only authorization boundary.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - invokes Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:510 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - validates request state, lifecycle, request ID, word count, and callback deadline through line 516.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:518 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - reduces the authenticated random word to a sold entry.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:519 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - stores winningEntry and resolvedAt through line 520.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:521 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - sets CashWon because totalEntries is below reserveEntries.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:523 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - emits RaffleResolved.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Persists winningEntry, resolvedAt, and status CashWon; emits RaffleResolved.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":521,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"Wrapper-authenticated randomWords[0] selects the winning entry; preexisting totalEntries below reserveEntries selects the cash-result branch. The draw requester cannot supply the random word.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This callback changes the economic outcome from NFT delivery to later cash allocation and sponsor-prize return.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A wrapper-authenticated callback arriving at or after the exclusive two-day callback deadline, but before refunds are enabled, is ignored and leaves the raffle in Drawing.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:253 Raffle.requestDraw - stores drawRequestedAt during successful initiation.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:463 Raffle.callbackDeadline - derives drawRequestedAt plus DRAW_CALLBACK_TIMEOUT.\",\"packages/contracts/src/libraries/RaffleConstants.sol:36 RaffleConstants.DRAW_CALLBACK_TIMEOUT - fixes the timeout at two days.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - receives the delayed response.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - authenticates the wrapper and dispatches through line 106.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:512 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - detects block.timestamp at or after callbackDeadline.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns through line 515.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored without storing the word or resolution; status remains Drawing.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":512,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The original transaction's submission time fixes drawRequestedAt; authenticated callback delivery timing reaches the deadline gate. The requester does not control the callback payload or delivery.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The strict cutoff prevents stale randomness from deciding the raffle after its refund path has become available.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"If no callback is accepted before the deadline, any account can move the entire unsettled quote-token pot into refund liability and transition the raffle to Refunding.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:252 Raffle.requestDraw - a successful request sets status Drawing.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:253 Raffle.requestDraw - records the timestamp defining the callback deadline.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:259 Raffle.requestDraw - persists the request ID and completes initiation.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:276 Raffle.enableRefunds - a later permissionless caller invokes the timeout continuation under nonReentrant.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:289 Raffle.enableRefunds - selects the Drawing-state branch.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:290 Raffle.enableRefunds - obtains callbackDeadline.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:291 Raffle.enableRefunds - permits the transition only at or after that deadline.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:296 Raffle.enableRefunds - reads the full unsettledPot liability.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:297 Raffle.enableRefunds - clears unsettledPot, stores remainingRefundLiability, and sets Refunding through line 299.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:300 Raffle.enableRefunds - emits RefundsEnabled.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Reclassifies the full unsettledPot as remainingRefundLiability, sets status Refunding, and emits RefundsEnabled.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":296,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The original requester's submission time becomes drawRequestedAt and fixes when this route opens; the later permissionless finalizer's identity is recorded only in the event. Existing unsettled USDC reaches the refund-liability state.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This is the liveness fallback that redirects the economic outcome from winner selection to full ticket refunds after oracle non-delivery or rejection.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"If the wrapper delivers the authenticated response after refunds have already been enabled, the callback is ignored because the raffle is no longer Drawing, preserving the refund outcome.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:299 Raffle.enableRefunds - the timeout continuation has set status Refunding after moving the pot into refund liability.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - later receives the authenticated asynchronous response.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - authenticates the immutable wrapper and dispatches through line 106.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - detects that status is not Drawing before using the request ID or random word.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns through line 515.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored; status remains Refunding and remainingRefundLiability is unchanged.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":511,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The original requester controls only initiation timing and funding. The later wrapper-authenticated word reaches the lifecycle gate but is discarded after the permissionless timeout transition.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This ordering-sensitive guard prevents delayed oracle fulfillment from overwriting finalized refund accounting or creating a winner after refund claims become available.\"}]}"}}
